01:19:35.170 --> 01:19:36.872
Anjir, agak terlalu kelihatan itu.

01:20:01.696 --> 01:20:02.697
Malu-maluin ya, ginian nih.

01:20:02.964 --> 01:20:04.533
Iya, malu-maluin banget ini.

01:20:04.933 --> 01:20:05.901
Malu, kan?

01:20:06.001 --> 01:20:07.903
