01:20:26.154 --> 01:20:27.155
Kagak liat.

01:20:27.923 --> 01:20:28.890
Masa sih?

01:20:30.492 --> 01:20:31.793
Gak kerasa aneh sama sekali ya.

01:20:36.698 --> 01:20:37.699
Keluar yuk.

01:20:38.166 --> 01:20:39.167
Keluar yuk.

01:20:39.501 --> 01:20:41.603
Harus milih buku dulu.

01:20:41.803 --> 01:20:42.804
Bener juga.

01:20:44.840 --> 01:20:48.376
Milih buku. Milih buku. Eh, tadi apaan ya?

01:21:07.362 --> 01:21:07.762
Apaan ya tadi?

01:21:42.030 --> 01:21:43.031
Soalnya biasa banget sih.

01:21:43.531 --> 01:21:44.532
Masa?

01:21:59.547 --> 01:22:21.703
Serem. Seru gak tadi?

01:22:21.870 --> 01:22:24.639
Seru. Gak seru. Seru kan?

01:22:25.073 --> 01:22:26.808
Gak seru. Seru ya?

01:22:27.042 --> 01:22:28.043
He-eh.

01:22:29.611 --> 01:22:31.646
Tuh, ada mata di kamera pengawas.

01:22:31.813 --> 01:22:33.581
Oh gitu. Terus gimana dong?

01:22:34.582 --> 01:22:35.550
Ah, santai aja kali.

01:22:36.685 --> 01:22:38.887
Nggak tahu. Kayaknya pelayannya lagi asyik sendiri.

01:22:40.488 --> 01:22:42.257
Kalau cewek pasti bakal kena omel.

01:22:42.891 --> 01:22:45.393
Iya. Lagi ngapain sih mereka.

01:22:50.532 --> 01:22:51.800
Gue jadi agak sange nih.

01:22:55.003 --> 01:22:56.004
Gimana?

01:23:07.449 --> 01:23:08.750
Nggak ngelihat, kan?

01:23:20.528 --> 01:23:21.529
Soalnya gue jadi agak sange.

01:23:25.767 --> 01:23:26.901
Di sini.

01:23:47.555 --> 01:24:28.530
Di sini. Boleh. Ada orang lewat?

01:24:28.830 --> 01:24:30.432
Ada sih, tapi nggak apa-apa.

01:24:31.733 --> 01:24:32.734
Kalau orang sih aman.

01:24:44.846 --> 01:24:45.847
Muncrat nih.

01:24:47.248 --> 01:24:48.249
Ayo.

01:24:52.687 --> 01:24:55.023
Buka, cepetan buka.

01:25:00.328 --> 01:25:01.329
Bikin sange banget.

01:25:32.827 --> 01:28:05.513
Darah tuh. Itu darah. Sadar nggak?

01:28:10.918 --> 01:28:23.998
Anjir. Gede banget?

01:28:24.799 --> 01:28:33.808
Kaget gue. Ngapain lo?

01:29:18.686 --> 01:29:19.821
Lagi ngapain sih?

01:29:19.821 --> 01:29:20.822
Gue pake kontol nih.

01:29:21.189 --> 01:29:22.190
Gue pake kontol ya.

01:29:22.390 --> 01:29:22.957
Iya.

01:29:23.291 --> 01:29:24.292
Wah.

01:31:01.956 --> 01:31:03.024
Sorry ya.

01:31:15.436 --> 01:31:16.437
Kejepit nih.

01:31:47.935 --> 01:32:52.700
Nggak apa-apa. Iya. Keluar banyak?

01:32:52.967 --> 01:32:53.968
Iya.

01:32:56.571 --> 01:32:58.139
Sini gue bersihin buat lo.

01:33:07.148 --> 01:33:08.149
Iya.

01:33:16.691 --> 01:33:17.692
Berubah bentuk.

01:33:30.838 --> 01:33:32.173
Ada fitur pijatnya segala.

01:33:33.107 --> 01:33:34.108
Masa sih?

01:33:50.658 --> 01:33:53.828
Pasti repot ya pake baju kayak begini. Repot banget.

01:33:54.161 --> 01:33:57.064
Ini soalnya, yah, gue mau sisanya.

01:33:57.231 --> 01:33:58.299
Gue pengen sisanya.

01:33:58.532 --> 01:33:59.900
Lagian bisa jadi lampu juga.

01:34:01.302 --> 01:34:02.703
Ah, udah dikasih ya.

01:34:03.571 --> 01:34:06.774
Feeling gue nih orang bakal mandi paling terakhir di rumah.

01:34:07.708 --> 01:34:08.709
Selamat pagi.

01:34:08.809 --> 01:34:09.810
Selamat pagi.

01:34:29.697 --> 01:34:30.698
Gila, mantap banget.

01:34:30.898 --> 01:34:48.215
Pagi buat orang kayak gini kayaknya nggak apa-apa deh.
Tinggal bareng. Boleh kan?

01:34:48.516 --> 01:34:53.921
Satu kamar. Boleh keluarin toket?

01:34:55.089 --> 01:34:56.090
Iya.

01:34:58.693 --> 01:34:59.694
Tinggal bareng ya.

01:34:59.927 --> 01:35:00.561
Satu kamar ya.

01:35:00.928 --> 01:35:02.430
Beresin kamar ya.

01:35:06.500 --> 01:35:08.402
Dia bilang lagi tidur.

01:35:28.389 --> 01:35:31.892
Ssst, jangan berisik.

01:35:32.460 --> 01:35:33.461
Terus, bentar...

01:35:54.915 --> 01:35:55.916
Lagi tidur dia.

01:35:59.820 --> 01:36:00.821
Tapi ya,

01:36:01.322 --> 01:36:02.323
Tapi ya,

01:36:05.092 --> 01:36:07.795
Bentar deh, lu kan lagi tidur. Kalo lagi tidur gitu,

01:36:08.362 --> 01:36:10.731
Kalo mandi, ntar malah bangun dong?

01:36:10.931 --> 01:36:11.932
Hah?

01:36:12.566 --> 01:36:12.767
Hah?

01:36:13.501 --> 01:36:15.803
Mandi? Kalo mandi?

01:36:16.203 --> 01:36:17.204
Lewat sini kali ya?

01:36:19.473 --> 01:36:20.207
Makanya,

01:36:20.307 --> 01:36:22.576
Mumpung lagi tenang, mumpung lagi tenang,

01:36:26.614 --> 01:36:28.282
Mainin ini dulu,

01:36:30.284 --> 01:36:32.119
Baru abis itu mandi.

01:36:43.130 --> 01:36:47.968
Lagian kalo mandi pasti bakal bangun juga.

01:36:50.204 --> 01:36:55.643
Bangun, bangun, bangun, bangun,
Bangun, bangun, bangun. Di sini ya?

01:36:55.709 --> 01:36:57.411
Bakal bangun di situ ya?

01:36:57.945 --> 01:36:58.946
Sebelah sini.

01:36:59.814 --> 01:37:00.881
Ruangannya adem.

01:37:01.315 --> 01:37:07.188
Coba buka dikit kamar yang adem ini. Bayangin deh. Ini kamar buat tidur ya?

01:37:48.028 --> 01:37:49.029
Boleh ngebayangin?

01:38:11.051 --> 01:38:13.754
Ayo lakuin sambil rebahan. Kan enak sambil rebahan.

01:38:14.121 --> 01:38:15.589
Ayo lakuin sambil rebahan.

01:38:15.723 --> 01:38:16.690
Lagi tidur nih.

01:38:19.159 --> 01:38:20.327
Diem dong.

01:38:20.527 --> 01:38:21.528
