01:40:32.493 --> 01:40:56.884
Malu lah. Beneran. Lagi tidur. Dia tidur ya?

01:40:57.317 --> 01:41:02.022
Tidur. Beneran tidur?

01:41:02.623 --> 01:41:10.030
Iya, tidur.

01:41:45.699 --> 01:41:46.700
Iya

01:42:08.322 --> 01:42:16.163
Nggak boleh?

01:42:20.801 --> 01:42:23.237
Soalnya belum mandi, makanya nggak boleh?

01:42:25.105 --> 01:42:28.242
Makanya, gapapa lah. Emang gara-gara itu nggak boleh?

01:42:28.275 --> 01:42:30.444
