01:46:08.261 --> 01:46:10.297
Gimana? Bener kan? Terus, harus gimana lagi?

01:46:10.630 --> 01:46:12.132
Ah, mantap tuh.

01:47:27.407 --> 01:47:28.408
Mmm...

01:47:31.478 --> 01:47:39.453
Mmm...

01:47:48.495 --> 01:47:49.563
Mmm...

01:47:50.564 --> 01:47:52.032
Mmm...

01:47:52.032 --> 01:47:53.033
Mmm...

01:47:53.567 --> 01:48:00.040
Enak kan?

01:48:00.440 --> 01:48:02.976
Mmm, enak kan? Iya kan?

01:48:28.168 --> 01:48:33.640
Ah, gila.

01:50:27.020 --> 01:50:34.894
Mantap banget.

01:50:35.195 --> 01:50:37.130
Gede banget... Gede.

01:50:50.143 --> 01:50:52.646
Balik badan, coba masukin setengah ke situ.

01:50:54.247 --> 01:50:56.683
Sini deketan dikit.

01:51:55.075 --> 01:51:56.976
Diem dulu ya gitu.

01:52:56.970 --> 01:53:04.811
Masa harus balik ke neraka kayak gitu...

01:56:13.533 --> 01:56:21.407
