01:57:46.059 --> 01:57:55.435
Biar dia istirahat dulu bentar. Makasih ya buat hari ini.

01:58:28.000 --> 01:58:31.604
Kelihatan banget kalau dia orang baik.

01:58:36.709 --> 01:58:42.281
Si Shime-chan emang baik banget ya. Lu ngerasa gitu juga?

01:58:44.784 --> 01:58:45.785
Seru juga...

01:58:47.920 --> 01:58:50.289
Biasanya emang kayak gini?

01:58:51.724 --> 01:58:53.860
Iya, emang kayak gini.

01:58:57.330 --> 01:58:58.331
Makasih banyak ya.

01:59:02.869 --> 01:59:08.174
Coba kita anterin dulu. Sori, gara-gara urusan si Yamada itu...

01:59:13.279 --> 01:59:13.846
..

01:59:14.780 --> 01:59:16.149
